title: "Fault-Characteristic-Order Soft Constraints for Few-Shot Bearing Fault Diagnosis"
abstract: >-
  Order-domain soft-constraint loss for few-shot bearing fault diagnosis, with a
  tachometer-free rotation-frequency estimator, a four-arm comparison of speed-prior
  sources, and an empirical characterisation of the method's validity boundary.
